# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT FOR A PUBLIC REPO
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exams/ holds the closed-book question banks WITH ANSWER SKETCHES. This
# repository is public: students can read anything committed here, and GitHub
# keeps deleted content in the history and in search caches. Leave this line
# alone. To share the banks with a TA, send the PDFs directly or use a private
# folder on Drive.
Exams/

# Superseded 15-module version of the course, kept on Drive only so nobody
# teaches from it by accident.
Archive_Modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX intermediates. The .tex is the source and the .pdf is committed so
# TAs can read the decks without a LaTeX install.
*.aux
*.log
*.nav
*.out
*.snm
*.toc
*.vrb
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# macOS and Google Drive
.DS_Store
.tmp.drivedownload/
.tmp.driveupload/

# compile.sh output
*.buildlog
